  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 57a8e05a8a1d4451e9081ab70ab1f576, type: 3}
  itemDescription: 'Advanced Materials Technologies Institute: This institute researches
    advanced materials that underpin new technologies. Its mission encompasses developing
    novel materials with superior properties (strength, heat resistance, conductivity,
    etc.) for use in aerospace, energy, electronics, and other industries. Focus
    areas include nanomaterials (like graphene and carbon fibers), composites, advanced
    polymers, ceramics, and material characterization techniques. The institute aims
    to support local industries (defense, petrochemicals, construction) by providing
    cutting-edge materials solutions and to foster new high-tech industries around
    materials science. By inventing and optimizing materials, it enables progress
    in multiple sectors (for example, lighter composites for automotive or better
    catalysts for refineries)'
